Description: SvxLink dashboard with SSE streamer
 Simple dashboard for SvxLink and M17. Provides SSE event streamer, history
 rotate scripts, Apache/Nginx integration, SVXLink event hooks, tmpfiles.d,
 systemd services and ELB backend daemon.
